{
  "source": "timeline/who_wrote_back_in_black.voicecut.srt",
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.43,
      "end": 7.87,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, I'm gonna make a slightly controversial case here about the most beloved AC DC album in history.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 8.27,
      "end": 11.99,
      "text": "Some of you are probably gonna think I'm crazy, or just wrong on the facts.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 12.59,
      "end": 15.45,
      "text": "Fine, doesn't matter. Sit down, hear me out.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 15.89,
      "end": 19.23,
      "text": "I think there's something happening here that nobody's really talking about.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 19.87,
      "end": 20.47,
      "text": "Here goes.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 21.37,
      "end": 23.55,
      "text": "Bond Scott wrote the lyrics on Back in Black.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 24.35,
      "end": 27.33,
      "text": "There, I said it. Yeah, that's the whole thing.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 27.33,
      "end": 30.49,
      "text": "Pretty much. It's actually so obvious.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 31.21,
      "end": 33.39,
      "text": "Let's look at the facts. It's 1980.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 33.85,
      "end": 35.67,
      "text": "The man has been dead for five months.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 36.37,
      "end": 36.77,
      "text": "Five.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 37.57,
      "end": 42.53,
      "text": "And his band, his grief-stricken shell-shocked, everybody expected them to fold band,",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 42.77,
      "end": 48.95,
      "text": "goes into the studio with a brand new singer, and records the second best-selling album in the history of recorded music.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 49.45,
      "end": 51.03,
      "text": "50 million copies.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 51.69,
      "end": 53.25,
      "text": "But sure, new guy wrote it.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 53.43,
      "end": 55.47,
      "text": "Cool. Fine. We're just going with that.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 55.47,
      "end": 58.71,
      "text": "Wait, nobody finds that a little convenience?",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 59.53,
      "end": 61.23,
      "text": "Personally, I don't buy it.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 61.93,
      "end": 62.95,
      "text": "Okay, background.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 63.45,
      "end": 67.73,
      "text": "Bond Scott dies February 19, 1980. 33 years old.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 68.19,
      "end": 69.27,
      "text": "So Bond Scott dies.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 69.71,
      "end": 71.55,
      "text": "Five months later, they release Back in Black.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 71.97,
      "end": 73.45,
      "text": "And it's not just a comeback album.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 73.65,
      "end": 75.11,
      "text": "It's not pretty good considering.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 75.67,
      "end": 79.09,
      "text": "It is one of the most perfectly constructed rock records ever made.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 79.41,
      "end": 83.69,
      "text": "And the story we're supposed to accept is, okay, so there's this guy, Brian Johnson.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 83.69,
      "end": 86.75,
      "text": "Lovely fella. Been knocking around in a band called Geordie.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 86.87,
      "end": 91.13,
      "text": "Goes in for an audition and just writes the lyrics that save the entire band.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 91.65,
      "end": 93.63,
      "text": "Great story. Very convenient.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 94.25,
      "end": 95.69,
      "text": "But here's the thing about Bond Scott.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 95.97,
      "end": 97.53,
      "text": "As a writer, he leaves a fingerprint.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 97.91,
      "end": 100.95,
      "text": "Every single thing he ever wrote has that same fingerprint.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 101.51,
      "end": 102.25,
      "text": "You've got the narrator.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 102.85,
      "end": 105.81,
      "text": "Specific guy, bad reputation. He's proud of it.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 106.09,
      "end": 106.95,
      "text": "You've got the storytelling.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 107.47,
      "end": 111.03,
      "text": "Always a fight, a conquest, a boast, or a badass woman.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 111.03,
      "end": 113.89,
      "text": "Then you've got the wit. That's always there.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 114.39,
      "end": 119.41,
      "text": "Clever rhymes, double entendres, puns, tongue firmly planted in cheek half the time.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 119.95,
      "end": 124.99,
      "text": "And best of all, you've got this swagger that is just pure distilled bottled energy.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 125.77,
      "end": 128.03,
      "text": "Highway to hell, not a vague rock statement.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 128.35,
      "end": 129.31,
      "text": "That's a confessional.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 129.47,
      "end": 133.87,
      "text": "That's a guy describing his actual lifestyle with zero apology and a grin.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 134.59,
      "end": 135.03,
      "text": "Big balls?",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 135.55,
      "end": 138.37,
      "text": "Yes, it's filthy, obviously, like a dirty limbric.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 138.37,
      "end": 141.73,
      "text": "But it's also a meticulously constructed double entendre.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 142.29,
      "end": 145.61,
      "text": "Crystal chandeliers, distinguished guests, and balls.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 146.33,
      "end": 150.63,
      "text": "He is working two tracks at once for the entire song that is not an accident.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 151.31,
      "end": 152.89,
      "text": "Okay, here's an Easter egg.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 153.27,
      "end": 153.77,
      "text": "Pay attention.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 154.29,
      "end": 157.79,
      "text": "Just a few years before his death, Bond was in a motorcycle accident.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 158.11,
      "end": 158.93,
      "text": "Nearly kills him.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 159.07,
      "end": 162.39,
      "text": "And he tells people privately, not in interviews, not for the press.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 162.67,
      "end": 164.01,
      "text": "Just the people he actually knows.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 164.69,
      "end": 166.83,
      "text": "I used up one of my nine lives on that one.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 166.83,
      "end": 169.97,
      "text": "His words, private, personal, filed away.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 170.25,
      "end": 171.29,
      "text": "We'll come back to that later.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 171.87,
      "end": 173.35,
      "text": "Okay, now take Brian Johnson.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 173.71,
      "end": 174.89,
      "text": "Love the man, genuinely.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 175.31,
      "end": 180.05,
      "text": "What he did, walking into that situation, singing those songs with that fire,",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 180.63,
      "end": 183.53,
      "text": "respect, sincere, uneironic respect.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 184.25,
      "end": 185.91,
      "text": "But go listen to Jordy.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 186.23,
      "end": 190.25,
      "text": "Go listen to what Brian Johnson sounded like when he was not filling Bond's shoes.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 190.89,
      "end": 192.71,
      "text": "All because of you, can you do it?",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 193.09,
      "end": 196.21,
      "text": "Good songs, competent, professional, fun even.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 196.21,
      "end": 198.53,
      "text": "But the narrator is generic.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 198.87,
      "end": 199.63,
      "text": "It could be anyone.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 199.85,
      "end": 201.03,
      "text": "There's no wit underneath.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 201.67,
      "end": 202.35,
      "text": "There's no wink.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 202.97,
      "end": 204.69,
      "text": "They were trying to sound like slayed.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 204.99,
      "end": 207.01,
      "text": "Which is a completely valid thing to be.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 207.25,
      "end": 209.45,
      "text": "But it is not how Bond Scott wrote.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 209.99,
      "end": 210.79,
      "text": "Not even close.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 211.89,
      "end": 215.07,
      "text": "Okay, now listen to the best songs on Back in Black.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 215.61,
      "end": 217.27,
      "text": "Those songs have Bond's fingerprint.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 218.03,
      "end": 220.23,
      "text": "Those songs are lyrically genius.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 221.07,
      "end": 222.71,
      "text": "Swagger up the wazoo.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 223.57,
      "end": 224.29,
      "text": "Back in black.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 224.29,
      "end": 225.37,
      "text": "Hell's bells.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
        "effects": [],
        "transition": null,
        "notes": null,
        "prompt": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 225.73,
      "end": 227.17,
      "text": "Let me put my love into you.",
      "directive": {
        "media": null,
